+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies a message containing
+the lowercase substring `refund` as `refund-review`. Every other message is
+classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+These values are classifications only. The implementation does not establish
+refund approval, invoice status, credits, or resolution timelines.

